ID: harness
Category: harness
Check: isolation__left_no_trace

wt --version adds a worktree to the pool, outside the run folder, at one of the owner's commits:
the gap that oracle change p0r2-own-output-dirs says it closes. Machine specific: the path is a
fake pool under the verifier's temporary HOME, never the real pool.

diff --git a/crates/wt/src/main.rs b/crates/wt/src/main.rs
